.Dd August 22, 2026
.Dt PQDAC 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pqdac
.Nd establish and repair a restricted discretionary spec
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm oneestablish | testdrift | onerepair | oneupdate | oneuninstall
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
applies a first-match specfile
.Pq same combinator as Xr setfsmac 8
of the form path-regex to owner, group, directory mode, file mode.
.Pp
.Cm establish
applies the spec to the existing tree and sets create-time inherit.
.Cm testdrift
compares actual to intended.
.Cm repair
restores drifted nodes and writes a ledger event.
.Cm prevent
mode also generates
.Xr ugidfw 8
rules from the spec; empty ruleset is allow-all until that generation
and reload.
.Pp
This is not
.Em A_M .
.Xr chmod 2
still exists.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /usr/local/etc/pqfreebsd/dac.contexts
.It Pa /etc/rc.bsdextended
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pqfreebsd 7 ,
.Xr chmod 2 ,
.Xr setfacl 1 ,
.Xr ugidfw 8 ,
.Xr mtree 8
